# Israel: one who wrestles with God

Avik, 2026-11-16: “Israel is committing genocide against Israel. But you don't know what Israel
really is then again do you, cause you're not Jewish how I am.” And: “long live judaism”, “death to
Zion … kill that concept. Kill that version of judaism”, “I'm talking about the ones that believe
